{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/competency_classreport_view

    The class report of report/competency/index.php as a data report (phase 6 part two): what the page must say
    above it, the way to core's table, one React mount and core's rendering of the report for a browser without
    JavaScript.

    The mount names js/esm/src/classreport/ClassReportView.tsx (class_report_view::COMPONENT), which core's
    react_autoinit loads. Its inner
    content is what the first paint shows until React commits, which replaces it: a skeleton in the shape of the
    band and the grid, and, behind it, one sentence that is true only if the component never mounts; the
    stylesheet swaps the two about 10 s after the first paint. Both show only under body.jsenabled.

    The props arrive already JSON-encoded by theme_dimensions\output\class_report_view, in one value, through a
    triple stash: nothing between here and React is an HTML context. They carry configuration and strings, never
    a record. The noscript is core's own HTML, rendered by core.

    The root keeps part one's region (dim-comp-classreport): theme_dimensions/classratings, armed once per page from
    the js block, opens core's grading dialogue from a rating cell inside it and tells the view when it closes.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * courseid - The course.
    * nogroup - Whether the group rule leaves the viewer no row.
    * nocompetency - Whether the course (or the chosen activity) has no competency.
    * nocompetencynotice - What to say then, plain.
    * props - The component's props, JSON.
    * tableurl - index.php with view=table.
    * noscript - Core's rendering of the report without its filter form, HTML.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "courseid": 2,
        "nogroup": false,
        "nocompetency": true,
        "nocompetencynotice": "No competency is linked to this course yet.",
        "props": "{\"courseid\": 2, \"moduleid\": 0, \"groupid\": 0}",
        "tableurl": "https://example.com/report/competency/index.php?id=2&view=table",
        "noscript": "<p>Core's report</p>"
    }
}}
<div class="dim-comp-classreport dim-comp-rview" data-region="dim-comp-classreport" data-courseid="{{courseid}}">
    {{#nogroup}}
    <div class="alert alert-info" role="status">{{#str}}competency_classreport_nogroup, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</div>
    {{/nogroup}}
    {{#nocompetency}}
    <div class="alert alert-info" role="status">{{nocompetencynotice}}</div>
    {{/nocompetency}}
    <p class="dim-comp-rview-tablelink">
        <a href="{{tableurl}}">{{#str}}competency_classreport_tableview, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</a>
    </p>
    {{#react}}
    {
        "component": "@moodle/lms/theme_dimensions/classreport/ClassReportView",
        "props": {{{props}}},
        "class": "dim-comp-rview-mount"
    }
    <div class="dim-comp-rview-preload" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="dim-comp-rview-band">
            <div class="dim-comp-rview-tile dim-comp-rview-sk"><span class="dim-comp-rview-skb"></span><span class="dim-comp-rview-skb dim-comp-rview-skb--big"></span></div>
            <div class="dim-comp-rview-tile dim-comp-rview-sk"><span class="dim-comp-rview-skb"></span><span class="dim-comp-rview-skb dim-comp-rview-skb--big"></span></div>
            <div class="dim-comp-rview-tile dim-comp-rview-sk"><span class="dim-comp-rview-skb"></span><span class="dim-comp-rview-skb dim-comp-rview-skb--big"></span></div>
            <div class="dim-comp-rview-tile dim-comp-rview-sk"><span class="dim-comp-rview-skb"></span><span class="dim-comp-rview-skb dim-comp-rview-skb--big"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="dim-comp-rview-skgrid dim-comp-rview-sk">
            <span class="dim-comp-rview-skb"></span>
            <span class="dim-comp-rview-skb"></span>
            <span class="dim-comp-rview-skb"></span>
            <span class="dim-comp-rview-skb"></span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="dim-comp-rview-failed">{{#str}}competency_classreport_mountfailed, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</p>
    {{/react}}
    <noscript>{{{noscript}}}</noscript>
</div>
{{#js}}
require(['theme_dimensions/classratings'], function(Classratings) {
    Classratings.init();
});
{{/js}}
